[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3758295474","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115022#issuecomment-3758295474","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115022","id":3758295474,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gAwmy","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-16T05:50:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T05:50:37Z","body":"Note that the bug in horizon link was introduced in 1.1.54, so even just setting 1.1.53 will work, but 1.1.53 has broken aim poses, so you'd need to revert to 1.1.47, which btw re-introduces the old straight aim poses instead of the new natural aim poses.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3758295474/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3767393532","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115022#issuecomment-3767393532","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115022","id":3767393532,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gjdz8","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T09:45:25Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T09:45:25Z","body":"For now I settled on `target_api_version`. It is an API and we name OpenXR an API all through the source code. But a rose by any other name, so I am happy to be convinced we should change it :)\r\n\r\nI've left out the part in the description around OpenXR version number, I worry it will only lead to confusion. The patch number currently being in sync between OpenXR 1.0 and 1.1 as extensions are added to both, is a Khronos thing that will only hold until OpenXR 2.0 is released. Also I worry that people may take it that they can simply enter `1.0` if they don't care about the patch number while the feature allows you to specify a fixed version without any fallbacks.\r\n\r\nI also very much hope we can remove this feature some time in the future.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3767393532/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3767625821","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115022#issuecomment-3767625821","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115022","id":3767625821,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gkWhd","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T10:36:18Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T10:36:18Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3767625821/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4096717261","ht